    "9:30 am in square: Phil spends the period at the square. You see Rita at the square. Larry says: Let's hold position and wait for the band to be ready, Phil. Larry spends the period at the square.",
    "1:00 pm in square: Phil uses the paid ticket and rides the coach all the way to Pittsburgh. Rita says: Larry, cue up the band feed. We are going live with this right after the weather. Rita records the town band on its afternoon stand. Larry says: Rita, I'm burning the last battery on the festival wide now so you have your anchor footage. Don't let anyone touch the switcher until I'm back at the studio with the card. Larry uses the camera's last charged take to film the festival."
